<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS3" title="In Appendix B Theoretical Analysis ‣ OBCache: Optimal Brain KV Cache Pruning for Efficient Long-Context LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.3 </span>Isolated Key-Pruning Score</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS4" title="In Appendix B Theoretical Analysis ‣ OBCache: Optimal Brain KV Cache Pruning for Efficient Long-Context LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.4 </span>Joint-Pruning Score</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS5" title="In Appendix B Theoretical Analysis ‣ OBCache: Optimal Brain KV Cache Pruning for Efficient Long-Context LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.5 </span>Reduction to Attention-Based Scores</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
