<div id="A5.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Due to space constraints, we present the full table results of LongBench in Table <a href="#A5.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ E.1 LongBench Full Tables ‣ Appendix E Experimental Results ‣ OBCache: Optimal Brain KV Cache Pruning for Efficient Long-Context LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and Table <a href="#A5.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ E.1 LongBench Full Tables ‣ Appendix E Experimental Results ‣ OBCache: Optimal Brain KV Cache Pruning for Efficient Long-Context LLM Inference" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
